"Randall ordered him to kill his Clan Matriarch, and his mother, sister or son."
"Randall promised to forge his valley into a sanctum for Randall's worship."
"He offered to kill all the males of his own clan to become a disciple."
"Markus judged him undeniably evil for speaking of murder so casually."
"He begged Markus to kill him: Please. I cannot bear such shame."
"His last words: I'm sorry that I was so weak. This shame will follow me."
"His corrupted core is in Markus's keeping as the Apostle Core, uncleansed."
